947
01:12:00,583 --> 01:12:01,416
Baiklah.

948
01:12:39,166 --> 01:12:40,333
Baik. Keluar dari air.

949
01:13:00,541 --> 01:13:02,583
GUA LANGKAN

950
01:13:07,500 --> 01:13:10,999
Itu gua langkan
tempat kita kehilangan Adrienne.

951
01:13:11,000 --> 01:13:12,125
Itu Devil's Mouth.

952
01:13:16,208 --> 01:13:17,458
Itu bukaan lautnya.

953
01:13:19,083 --> 01:13:25,208
TEROWONGAN SARANG MADU
GUA KERANGKA

954
01:13:28,458 --> 01:13:30,166
Kita kembali ke titik awal.

955
01:13:43,791 --> 01:13:44,625
Tidak!

956
01:14:05,250 --> 01:14:06,249
Kau sedang apa?

957
01:14:06,250 --> 01:14:07,708
Cuma membawa yang diperlukan.

958
01:14:11,416 --> 01:14:12,375
Kau menyalahkanku?

959
01:14:13,750 --> 01:14:14,583
Atas James?

960
01:14:18,708 --> 01:14:19,749
Tidak.

961
01:14:19,750 --> 01:14:20,916
Aku berusaha.

962
01:14:22,083 --> 01:14:24,540
Aku menariknya, aku terus menarik

963
01:14:24,541 --> 01:14:27,125
- tanpa henti.
- Aku tahu.

964
01:14:29,541 --> 01:14:30,458
Aku mencintainya.

965
01:14:31,583 --> 01:14:32,583
Aku menyayanginya.

966
01:14:38,500 --> 01:14:39,333
Aku tahu.

967
01:14:43,375 --> 01:14:44,625
Kita sudah coba caramu.

968
01:14:47,041 --> 01:14:48,583
Tapi kita kembali ke awal.

969
01:14:50,041 --> 01:14:51,750
Pintu keluarnya di sana, Sara.

970
01:14:54,916 --> 01:14:55,750
Tetap di sini.

971
01:14:58,666 --> 01:15:00,457
- Tidak.
- Biar kuperiksa.

972
01:15:00,458 --> 01:15:01,583
Tidak.

973
01:15:38,166 --> 01:15:41,583
- Apa yang kau lakukan?
- Itu terowongan biru. Pintu keluarnya.

974
01:15:42,833 --> 01:15:43,666
Kembali!

975
01:16:02,916 --> 01:16:05,541
Diam. Aku tak mau kau terlihat.

976
01:16:13,958 --> 01:16:14,791
Di mana?

977
01:16:43,166 --> 01:16:45,375
Aku tak tahu jalannya, terlalu gelap.

978
01:16:47,625 --> 01:16:49,166
Baik. Nyalakan sentermu.

979
01:16:50,541 --> 01:16:52,415
Baik. Sebentar saja.

980
01:16:52,416 --> 01:16:54,500
Aku tak mau ia melihat kita
jika masih ada.

981
01:17:17,333 --> 01:17:18,166
Kau sedang apa?

982
01:17:19,250 --> 01:17:20,833
- Melihat jalannya.
- Matikan.

983
01:18:16,416 --> 01:18:17,250
Jangan bergerak.

984
01:18:19,875 --> 01:18:20,708
Adrienne.

985
01:18:22,583 --> 01:18:23,416
Tidak.

986
01:18:29,291 --> 01:18:30,332
Lihat titik itu?

987
01:18:30,333 --> 01:18:33,582
Ayo sembunyi di stalagmit sampai ia pergi,
jangan sampai diikuti

988
01:18:33,583 --> 01:18:35,374
- ke terowongan.
- Tidak.

989
01:18:35,375 --> 01:18:36,208
Tak bisa.

990
01:18:47,000 --> 01:18:48,750
Max, berhenti!

991
01:18:49,250 --> 01:18:51,625
- Tapi sudah dekat.
- Sial.

992
01:18:58,916 --> 01:19:02,125
Max! Lihat!

993
01:19:05,125 --> 01:19:06,958
Tidak! Jangan!

994
01:19:15,541 --> 01:19:16,500
Hei!

995
01:19:31,416 --> 01:19:32,250
Tidak!

996
01:19:33,708 --> 01:19:34,666
Tidak!

997
01:19:35,708 --> 01:19:36,541
Di sini!

998
01:19:42,208 --> 01:19:43,291
Tidak!

999
01:19:53,500 --> 01:19:56,625
Hei! Di sini!

1000
01:19:57,375 --> 01:20:00,791
Hei! Ke sini!

1001
01:20:26,833 --> 01:20:28,541
- Astaga.
- Kita sudah dekat.

1002
01:20:29,291 --> 01:20:30,125
Tidak.

1003
01:20:32,166 --> 01:20:34,624
- Kau bisa berenang?
- Tidak. Kita terjebak.

1004
01:20:34,625 --> 01:20:38,041
Tak apa. Kita ke bukaan laut itu.
Jika pergi sekarang, kita bisa…

1005
01:21:02,291 --> 01:21:06,291
GUA
DEVIL'S MOUTH

1006
01:21:16,083 --> 01:21:19,166
PEMANDANGAN LAUT

1007
01:21:22,541 --> 01:21:23,375
Di mana hiu itu?

1008
01:21:25,625 --> 01:21:26,458
Kuharap mati.

1009
01:21:40,000 --> 01:21:43,625
Kita tidak akan ke LA, 'kan?

1010
01:21:57,291 --> 01:21:58,333
Kita masih di sini.

1011
01:22:03,541 --> 01:22:04,791
Begitu pergi dari sini,

1012
01:22:06,291 --> 01:22:09,625
kita bisa melakukan apa pun
dan pergi ke mana pun kita mau.

1013
01:22:10,375 --> 01:22:14,375
Kita masih punya waktu untuk memikirkan

1014
01:22:16,208 --> 01:22:17,833
bagaimana hidup setelah ini.

1015
01:22:24,416 --> 01:22:25,250
Terapi.

1016
01:22:27,291 --> 01:22:29,458
New York mungkin lebih baik untuk terapi.

1017
01:22:36,291 --> 01:22:37,208
Waspadalah.

1018
01:22:42,208 --> 01:22:43,125
Baiklah.

1019
01:24:14,083 --> 01:24:14,916
Sial.

1020
01:24:28,708 --> 01:24:31,083
- Apa?
- Di bawah cuma bebatuan.

1021
01:24:31,666 --> 01:24:33,166
Jadi, sudah berakhir?

1022
01:24:34,250 --> 01:24:37,374
Kau tak bisa memanjat ke bawah
dengan talimu?

1023
01:24:37,375 --> 01:24:39,541
Kurang panjang. Ini sangat…

1024
01:24:40,916 --> 01:24:42,000
Astaga.

1025
01:24:42,958 --> 01:24:45,874
Tapi katamu ini akan berhasil.
Katamu pasti berhasil.

1026
01:24:45,875 --> 01:24:48,958
Tak apa-apa.
Biarkan aku berpikir dulu. Ini…

1027
01:24:50,333 --> 01:24:53,791
Ini sedang surut,
kita tunggu air pasang, lalu kita bisa…

1028
01:24:55,625 --> 01:24:57,208
memanjat dalam beberapa jam.

1029
01:25:01,500 --> 01:25:02,333
Baik.

1030
01:25:05,958 --> 01:25:11,500
Aku pergi sendiri dan semoga airnya
cukup tinggi untuk aku melompat.

1031
01:25:16,833 --> 01:25:17,833
Bagaimana jika tidak?

1032
01:25:20,708 --> 01:25:21,625
Maka aku…

1033
01:25:23,250 --> 01:25:26,041
tenggelam, lalu kau mati
dimakan hiu, entahlah.

1034
01:25:34,083 --> 01:25:34,916
Pasti berhasil.

1035
01:25:38,916 --> 01:25:40,083
Ini peluang terbaik.

1036
01:26:44,416 --> 01:26:45,250
Sara!

1037
01:26:48,500 --> 01:26:49,583
Kirim bantuan, ya?

1038
01:26:50,833 --> 01:26:53,666
Aku tahu kita melalui neraka,
tapi ini bukan salahku.

1039
01:26:59,291 --> 01:27:00,708
Semua ini bukan salahku.

1040
01:27:03,000 --> 01:27:05,625
Astaga! Jangan tinggalkan aku di sini!

1041
01:27:10,583 --> 01:27:12,208
Apa yang kau lakukan? Jangan!

1042
01:27:12,791 --> 01:27:13,791
Orang berubah.

1043
01:27:24,166 --> 01:27:25,000
Hei.

1044
01:27:26,291 --> 01:27:28,916
Tak apa-apa.
Tinggal beberapa jam lagi. Kenapa?

1045
01:27:40,083 --> 01:27:41,125
Apa?

1046
01:27:42,125 --> 01:27:43,666
Aku akan mati sendirian di sini.

1047
01:27:45,583 --> 01:27:46,666
Aku tahu itu.

1048
01:27:53,416 --> 01:27:54,250
Hei.

1049
01:27:56,458 --> 01:27:57,291
Kau dan aku,

1050
01:27:59,583 --> 01:28:01,166
selamanya, 'kan?

1051
01:28:02,583 --> 01:28:03,416
Ya?

1052
01:28:06,083 --> 01:28:07,708
Tapi kau harus lakukan sesuatu

1053
01:28:08,250 --> 01:28:10,500
yang belum pernah kita lakukan.

1054
01:28:11,708 --> 01:28:14,125
Berenang dengan tangan patah?

1055
01:28:15,416 --> 01:28:16,250
Bukan.

1056
01:28:18,000 --> 01:28:18,833
Memercayaiku.

1057
01:28:37,208 --> 01:28:39,250
Aku dengar suara ombaknya makin dekat.

1058
01:28:44,416 --> 01:28:45,791
Kau akan kirim bantuan?

1059
01:28:47,041 --> 01:28:48,500
- Tentu saja.
- Sara, tunggu.

1060
01:28:49,083 --> 01:28:52,500
Seumur hidupku,
kukira aku yang harus kuat.

1061
01:28:55,916 --> 01:28:58,250
Demi ayahku, demi teman-temanku.

1062
01:29:00,333 --> 01:29:01,958
Kukira aku harus memikul semuanya.

1063
01:29:03,458 --> 01:29:04,541
Tapi aku tak sadar.

1064
01:29:08,208 --> 01:29:09,666
Betapa kuatnya dirimu.

1065
01:29:11,916 --> 01:29:13,041
Maafkan aku.

1066
01:29:15,833 --> 01:29:16,666
Aku sungguh…

1067
01:29:18,000 --> 01:29:19,708
Aku minta maaf.

1068
01:29:23,416 --> 01:29:24,500
Aku akan kembali.

1069
01:30:09,416 --> 01:30:11,250
Tunggu! Kumohon!

1070
01:30:12,083 --> 01:30:13,958
Apa? Apa yang kau lakukan?

1071
01:30:15,333 --> 01:30:16,915
Kembali ke bebatuan!

1072
01:30:16,916 --> 01:30:18,375
Aku mau ikut!

1073
01:30:18,875 --> 01:30:20,457
Tidak bisa. Tanganmu patah.

1074
01:30:20,458 --> 01:30:21,916
Aku akan kembali.

1075
01:30:23,291 --> 01:30:24,750
Aku pasti bisa, Max.

1076
01:30:25,375 --> 01:30:27,000
Kumohon, jangan tinggalkan aku.

1077
01:30:34,916 --> 01:30:35,916
Kau bisa naik?

1078
01:30:44,375 --> 01:30:45,208
Baik, tunggu!

1079
01:30:52,250 --> 01:30:54,750
Pegang talinya! Ikat di pinggangmu.

1080
01:30:55,875 --> 01:30:56,958
Sekuat mungkin.

1081
01:31:23,750 --> 01:31:24,666
- Baiklah.
- Siap?

1082
01:31:26,875 --> 01:31:28,708
- Mulai panjat.
- Baiklah.

1083
01:31:42,583 --> 01:31:44,458
Baiklah.

1084
01:31:47,916 --> 01:31:48,916
Tidak!

1085
01:31:50,166 --> 01:31:51,332
Kakiku tergelincir!

1086
01:31:51,333 --> 01:31:52,166
Baiklah.

1087
01:31:53,625 --> 01:31:54,958
Coba lagi.

1088
01:31:57,458 --> 01:31:58,291
Baiklah.

1089
01:31:58,916 --> 01:31:59,750
Astaga.

1090
01:32:03,041 --> 01:32:04,041
Baiklah.

1091
01:32:05,125 --> 01:32:05,958
Baiklah.

1092
01:32:12,916 --> 01:32:14,458
Baiklah.

1093
01:32:16,750 --> 01:32:18,458
Kita berhasil, Sara! Berhasil!

1094
01:33:06,083 --> 01:33:07,125
Max.

1095
01:33:37,541 --> 01:33:39,082
Hormati guanya.

1096
01:33:39,083 --> 01:33:40,833
Ini Gua Kerangka.

1097
01:33:41,625 --> 01:33:43,791
<i>Kita tamu di sini. Gua ini tuannya.</i>

1098
01:34:03,875 --> 01:34:04,790
<i>Sara!</i>

1099
01:34:04,791 --> 01:34:06,458
Darurat untuk berfoto.

1100
01:34:24,708 --> 01:34:28,166
Batunya rapuh. Kau buat runtuh, kita mati.

1101
01:35:12,541 --> 01:35:13,375
Hei!

1102
01:35:15,333 --> 01:35:16,708
Kemarilah!

1103
01:35:45,833 --> 01:35:46,875
Waktunya makan malam.

1104
01:36:32,375 --> 01:36:33,208
Hei!

1105
01:36:36,541 --> 01:36:37,375
Ayo!

1106
01:36:55,333 --> 01:37:00,166
Ayo! Kembali! Kemari! Sekali lagi! Ayo!

